{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Notice that this expression has the following special form:\n\n$(a+b)(a-b)$\n\nThis form expands to what we call \"a difference of squares\":\n\n$(\\blueD a+\\maroonC b)(\\blueD a-\\maroonC b)=\\blueD a^2-\\maroonC b^2$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Using the above pattern, we get:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{3x}+\\maroonC 7)(\\blueD{3x}-\\maroonC 7)\u0026=(\\blueD{3x})^2-\\maroonC 7^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9x^2-49\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Expand.**  \n*If necessary, combine like terms.*\n\n$(3x+7)(3x-7)=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"buttonsVisible":"focused","considered":"correct","form":true,"functions":["f","g","h"],"key":0,"linterContext":{"contentType":"","highlightLint":false,"paths":[],"stack":[]},"simplify":false,"times":false,"value":"9x^{2}-49"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"static":false,"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
